        shortAnswer:
            "The SEVP Portal is an online self-service platform managed by ICE where F-1 students on STEM OPT can directly report and update their personal information, including U.S. address, employer details, and employer name or address changes. It provides STEM OPT students with a way to fulfill their reporting obligations without relying solely on their DSO.",
